\pard\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs22\lang9\tab Rufus 4.16 BETA (2026.10.30)\fs10\b0\par\fs22\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sl276\slmult1\fs16  Finally work around the AMI NTFS driver bug, so that runtime UEFI media validation can work on the millions of PCs that AMI screwed up\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Finally report USB 3.2+ devices\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix the CA 2023 updated files not being taken into account during runtime UEFI media validation\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix the "Silent" installation option being potentially applied even when all dependencies aren't met\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix a regression where "Write as ESP" used the whole drive, instead of the expected 1 GB partition\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Fix WUE timezone duplication for non English locales and reinstate the use of dots in local usernames\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Add classic right click context menu restoration to the QoL improvements option (courtesy of Frédéric Lachapelle)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Drop the ever problematic use of Group Policies when disabling the "Do you want to format this drive?" prompt\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improve raw image partition (re)mount (courtesy of Jared Hagel)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Update embedded GRUB to version 2.16\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Update libcdio to latest\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Update the official DBX URLs, since they were changed by Microsoft\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Address multiple vulnerabilities, courtesy of @indep-arg, Andreas Fehlner, Adam Korczynski and Ramesh Adhikari\par

\pard\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 IF YOU ENCOUNTER ANY ISSUE WITH THIS BETA, \ul REPORT\ulnone  IT!\par
